{"id":10000046,"name":"胡桃","enName":"Hu Tao","title":"雪霁梅香","element":"火","region":"璃月","rarity":5,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"7月15日","constellation":"引蝶座","description":"「往生堂」七十七代堂主，年纪轻轻就已主掌璃月的葬仪事务。","affiliation":"往生堂","cv":{"chinese":"陶典","japanese":"高桥李依","english":"布丽安娜·尼克博克","korean":"金贺娄"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000046-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000046-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Hu_Tao.zip","voicePackageEn":"Hu_Tao","quoteCount":77,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"唷，找本堂主有何贵干呀？嗯？你不知道吗，往生堂第七十七代堂主就是胡桃我啦！嘶，不过瞧你的模样，容光焕发，身体健康，嗯…想必是为了工作以外的事来找我，对吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/73ne3fbhw4emno2z3ss6wf7zjdmpph9.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·往生堂","desc":"不如去我那儿喝杯茶？嘿~","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_explore_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cd/mh8ksq83vyqgm9m065emzzstw9skjaa.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·客户","desc":"一个客户，两个客户，三个客户…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_explore_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/tvyofehz8s6msfyrlui81yk3shng2jb.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·偷懒","desc":"咳咳…太阳出来我晒太阳，月亮出来我晒月亮咯~","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_explore_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/2fnjqvot4urhojue61nnct93s94kpg4.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"哎呀…麻烦喽。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/cy99g7me4ey8as8khsvsnbfddtd7l72.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"打雷啦，起身啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/12v7bbiqbyl826n2edjinxolaccatws.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"哇，是雪！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e2/0isxpqf4zpcm4fanbp63oc5mqotcfw6.mp3"},{"title":"起风的时候…","desc":"嗯，真舒服。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_weather_breeze_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/22l2uyt435ft1zrk7lq26q8unvbfi10.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"欸？…唉，帽子都要吹飞了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/78/4fcrr28xm04kl0jo741yxcjmz0v217j.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"嗯~早起身体好，晚睡人会飘。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/n8gei38e7k4v8os3scp7uormhc633ib.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"哟！中午好呀，吃了吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/kmv4y3qxzawo4lvza5sto2hqs4asxcj.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"嘻嘻，月亮出来喽~咱也出门吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/9p3stmpojfh2pmodmvi6srkjo55e9l9.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"哦，困了吗？那你好好休息，我一个人四处转转。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/q6ymtmnso0jo7ee0k1flsrik7hsoriu.mp3"},{"title":"关于胡桃自己·名字","desc":"胡桃的胡是胡吃海喝的胡，胡桃的桃却不是淘气的淘！嘿嘿…不、不好笑吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/fjutt3fmqzb4fxbxqp9zbuqu7pmes24.mp3"},{"title":"关于胡桃自己·拿手好戏","desc":"变个戏法给你看，瞧好了哦…火！然后…嚯！火蝴蝶！呼，飞啦——哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/prsi3chthxjbjree9f3w8e46b4cckoe.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·好奇心","desc":"你到处旅行，一定见多识广。有空也给我讲讲你自己的故事吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/kwcppgh64xx830viwn7sge236e55c46.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·夜晚","desc":"白天你尽管到处跑，晚上可得小心点。我不在的时候，务必谨慎行动。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/0lqal4lydx4k5nz8xps3fg08gxyzi3u.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·帮手","desc":"需要帮手吗？需要帮手吗？我来啦！若你需要帮助，胡桃我定当全力以赴，绝不推辞。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/4hls20hljo2hz799sfps4rpfmldqvdt.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·战斗","desc":"战斗是件麻烦事，对我来说，它不是目的而是手段。用手段来达到目的，用战斗来维护不愿让步的东西。就这方面而言，我和你是一样的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_close3","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/doia9xkvdig5vq8wg6qm7lvqvj5649t.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"「神之眼」…「神之眼」？唔，这东西，随缘就好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/p5o92bxl1wfo591z9vptcz6gjt95bhs.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"受人之托，忠人之事。我们往生堂性质特殊，肩负着双倍责任，所以，一定要让两个世界的人都满意才行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/1lao7ofguu7lbxkrdr7ir6o6hn6544y.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"有些花草只长在阴气重月光多的地方，你见过吗？没有？那下次带你见识见识。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/iczx29teywtthmoahgmhz5ayqs0k4ii.mp3"},{"title":"关于钟离…","desc":"钟离长得那么年轻，性格倒像是个老古董，什么都懂，却什么都不关心，他该不会…？嘻嘻…\n唉，算了，随他去吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_zhongli_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/3drf7i78ayusd96q35k4m6oluvsx8fq.mp3"},{"title":"关于七七…","desc":"看到七七了吗？快告诉我她在哪，我要把她藏起来，嘿！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_qiqi_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/2zb8j3f7fc1l9kqfhwkrlfnkmcz8jo0.mp3"},{"title":"关于白术…","desc":"白术？哼，麻烦的家伙。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_baizhu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/2kwijgrpbl5onfic6t05zzc7moq0kir.mp3"},{"title":"关于凝光…","desc":"天权凝光，富甲一方；明眸善睐，桃羞杏让；目达耳通，百了千当！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_ningguang_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/pk836bomrt9wpikb7f6p05av4jgslsy.mp3"},{"title":"关于北斗…","desc":"北斗姐可是璃月名人，她不认识我没关系，我认识她就行。啊~真想和她交个朋友啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_beidou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/6nmlcmh6ybn2wf6jqiacn9cpsq0eto6.mp3"},{"title":"关于行秋…","desc":"听说行秋少爷在写书？话本还是怪谈呢？好想把平日遇见的杂事说给他听，写成书一定很好看吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_xingqiu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/8100s5vd225243k472gl0hplm9eb5uc.mp3"},{"title":"关于重云…","desc":"纯阳正气，阴阳合一？啧啧，嘶…没想到世上真有这种体质的人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_chongyun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/k0huqtcfrs442ppkif43tqqd14ks12k.mp3"},{"title":"关于魈…","desc":"仙家的事，我怎么知道？哎呀呀，天机不可泄露。你就别问我啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_xiao_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/oo9d8238aoubdp6cz87c1h9t2aa8c9n.mp3"},{"title":"关于刻晴…","desc":"「玉衡」刻晴啊，嘶…是个很难打交道的人呢。嘿嘿，瞧那一本正经的样子，真想逗逗她。哎呦，她应该不会用剑敲我头吧？不会的吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_keqing_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/g5pmznrh5rc370a4r8maocz71l64qop.mp3"},{"title":"关于香菱…","desc":"香菱可好玩了，一碰就跳，特别容易被唬住。做我们这行，最喜欢这种人喽。不过也得注意分寸，毕竟，锅巴会替香菱出头呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_xiangling_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/cal1jjb94h3g2lezmjhx6x3xxbhfq95.mp3"},{"title":"关于云堇…","desc":"云堇她在正式场合很优雅，私底下却非常容易亲近哦！上次我跟她打了个赌，输的人要用自己习惯的唱法唱对方填的词。哎呀呀，戏腔版的丘丘谣，你真该听一次！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_yunjin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/7jh4rm2nlnsqoa6vka8mmmut9sfa6tj.ogg"},{"title":"关于申鹤…","desc":"她可真是个有意思的人呐，跟别人都不一样。你说，要是我从现在开始天天吃仙草、喝山露，会不会也变成她那么不染红尘的样子？嘿嘿…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_shenhe_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/taey1g00bw21y23fngd6s94gc46b4hg.ogg"},{"title":"关于蓝砚…","desc":"蓝姑娘啊…她实力不俗，可不仅仅是「皮毛」这么简单。奇门秘术可真了不得，病气死气都被搬走啦。哎呀，可谓是——世风日上，身强力壮，往生堂的生意越来越难做喽。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_teammate_lanyan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/t4xuskpfsbi7qdr1eohav792mmkc7nb.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解胡桃·其一","desc":"大丘丘病了，二丘丘瞧；三丘丘采药，四丘丘熬；五丘丘死了，六丘丘抬~\n欸…呼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/pfpqhnpnlf07hwdjud6f3ilsg840osm.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解胡桃·其二","desc":"小巷派暗黑打油诗人，正是本人！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/ci17kr8v321lp2ghkoenat3c1oqjsns.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解胡桃·其三","desc":"若要我说，往生堂的工作既不困难也不可怕，只是麻烦而已。可惜旁人理解不了，见到咱们夜里出工，总是有些惧怕。唉，是他们不懂啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/su27lo1dp1ce0hktg4fs3cxhvd9kgvd.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解胡桃·其四","desc":"我是「往生堂」第七十七代堂主，我爷爷是第七十五代。我经手的第一份工作，就是替爷爷办葬礼。是不是很意外啊？哎呀，不知不觉就在这行做了好些年，时间过得可真快。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/pz3c4cb02xlpasaaxm84gpbpsnk4kjk.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解胡桃·其五","desc":"阴阳有序，命运无常。死亡难以预测，却也有它的规矩。记住了，无论何时何地，无论有何原因，人都不该轻易挑衅「死」之一事。唯有认识它、尊重它，才能明白活着的价值。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/o2epwmibriut8c6l7fuewv4l2e3yrj7.mp3"},{"title":"胡桃的爱好…","desc":"天清海阔，皓月凌空，此情此景，正适合作诗一首。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/qbq04xabrowdptupkv3fz2ulw84ubcg.mp3"},{"title":"胡桃的烦恼…","desc":"唉…真想找些新乐子，无所事事比死亡可怕多了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/ph9ongvx2ikhvgfa5uy6dm2n21fjpq6.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"♪啦啦啦啦~吃水煮鱼配虾饺啦~","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/h0buvyu6mtd357ldvd8h19ziopdyqst.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"清心炒史莱姆凝液…呕…这是香菱对我的复仇吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/36qiduvdczfici65noav3gmq4s60izw.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"甚好甚好。本堂主现在就来为这道菜肴题诗一首——","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/dstjhbppb0v8dhjxnrmt77ibccz1zig.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"真不用我来帮忙吗？做一道送一道哦！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ec/k6he3c6qchxbpg2vagheskxjdrkgcti.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"噫…这是什么东西呀？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/569v98k1dtxzsel5k4ik9sr7bs8tcxv.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"今夜天星璀璨，月相壮丽，想必是个好日子。嘶，待我一算…嗯~我知道我知道，是你的生辰！哎呀，真是个好日子。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2c/f1mcgur6tybix9kgvug129m58g4cvn8.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"哦呀？哦呀呀？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/1bxid2ud8xdv491mpn6z1nf598l6bw6.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"嗯~真不错，谢啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/adv64oc93v6r8lgzqa22jbgy0bch3a4.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"没想到没想到，胡桃我现在力如泉涌，心似雄鹰，非常有自信哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/elvpyik4ohae1oosyatobtf6fz23b4i.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"力量若达到极限，接着考验的便是人心。多亏了你，我才能来到这片未曾踏足的领域。在这里，心和灵魂就像一片云彩…生老病死，天地万象，尽在吾辈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/spt6d44bikb46mjqm2im25cx5k4dhkl.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"喝！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e5/99ir3mxbobxvui4kpk5gi33mqie8cn1.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"起！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9c/3vjk702tmtaz8q7pg5oct9svhi7sux9.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"散！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/3tgc528b3hlbq1xfbn49jhuy2xqorg6.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"吃饱喝饱，一路走好！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/klxwtjkkpjut1j3lx9r3a7cfyy06qf9.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"再会啦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_hutao/vo_hutao_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/sbpquovm4o2gdxalp29gn76arms48ml.mp3"}